Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.00,en,,0,0,0,,Peek-a-boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:11.04,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.84,en,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to startle you, my little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:20.28,en,,0,0,0,,Hush, little vampire, don't say a word
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:23.08,en,,0,0,0,,Papa's gonna bite the head off a bird
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.18,0:01:28.09,en,,0,0,0,,A-bitty goo-bah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:30.29,en,,0,0,0,,I want to kiss your tush.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:32.36,en,,0,0,0,,I want to kiss your tush!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.94,en,,0,0,0,,Nice, but maybe a little more square footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:50.61,en,,0,0,0,,I want a lot of monsters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.15,en,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you, little Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.15,0:02:01.29,en,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.05,0:02:05.39,en,,0,0,0,,What out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:07.76,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, we never go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:09.09,en,,0,0,0,,Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:15.37,en,,0,0,0,,"And then the monsters ran away and were forced into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:17.24,en,,0,0,0,,"But Harry the Human found them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:19.10,en,,0,0,0,,"and jumped out from under their bed."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.19,en,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.19,0:02:21.27,en,,0,0,0,,"And burned their clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.24,en,,0,0,0,,"And bit their toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:25.28,en,,0,0,0,,"And took their candy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:29.55,en,,0,0,0,,Don't take my candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:32.65,en,,0,0,0,,Babyclaws, you don't need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:37.09,en,,0,0,0,,I promised your mommy I would protect you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:43.69,en,,0,0,0,,My beautiful May-vey
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:48.17,en,,0,0,0,,Let me wipe all your poop away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:52.14,en,,0,0,0,,Those humans are nas-tay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:56.61,en,,0,0,0,,So with Daddy you will stay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:03:00.81,en,,0,0,0,,And if a human tries to harm you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.18,en,,0,0,0,,I'll simply say
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:08.72,en,,0,0,0,,Because you're Daddy's girl
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.99,en,,0,0,0,,Daddy's girl
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:14.66,en,,0,0,0,,Just bend the legs and push off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:16.56,en,,0,0,0,,Trust me, mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:21.03,en,,0,0,0,,I can fly! I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.20,en,,0,0,0,,Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.50,en,,0,0,0,,Faster, baby! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:26.20,en,,0,0,0,,You got it, my little voodoo doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.08,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:35.88,en,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:37.88,en,,0,0,0,,Ow. I'm Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.45,en,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:43.12,en,,0,0,0,,Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.99,en,,0,0,0,,Only monsters can get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:46.56,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.79,en,,0,0,0,,It's hidden real nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:51.66,en,,0,0,0,,You got 400 acres of haunted forest in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:54.90,en,,0,0,0,,You got the Land of the Undead on the perimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:56.83,en,,0,0,0,,Any humans daring to even look over there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.77,en,,0,0,0,,will run away real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.22,en,,0,0,0,,But, of course, be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.86,en,,0,0,0,,No bonfires, no firework shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:20.36,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, no, no. No fire, I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.36,en,,0,0,0,,It's time, my darling Martha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:29.83,en,,0,0,0,,The place we always talked about for Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.54,en,,0,0,0,,No one will ever harm her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.56,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a mess back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:45.58,en,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Hotel Transylvania!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.35,en,,0,0,0,,Human-free since 1898.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:52.02,en,,0,0,0,,Your safest destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.68,en,,0,0,0,,Take an itinerary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:56.69,en,,0,0,0,,I have personally designed a spectacular schedule of events,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:06:00.42,en,,0,0,0,,all leading to my daughter's birthday extravaganza tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.63,en,,0,0,0,,We always look forward to coming every year, Count.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.63,en,,0,0,0,,We enjoy the safety so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:06.96,en,,0,0,0,,Of course. That's why we built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.40,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.83,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:12.20,en,,0,0,0,,You look pale, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:13.84,en,,0,0,0,,Sir, sir, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:15.27,en,,0,0,0,,We have an urgent plumbing issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:16.71,en,,0,0,0,,Plumbing? On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.74,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ghouligan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:21.88,en,,0,0,0,,There is a clogged toilet in room 348.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:25.68,en,,0,0,0,,It's Okay. We all get stomach aches, Mr. Bigfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:35.06,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids, reel it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.26,en,,0,0,0,,You're only supposed to make Mom and Dad miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.76,en,,0,0,0,,Now, now, is that any way to behave?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:42.97,en,,0,0,0,,This is a hotel, not a cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.97,0:06:44.77,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Uncle Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.24,en,,0,0,0,,Drac! How are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:48.77,en,,0,0,0,,Wayne, my old friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:50.27,en,,0,0,0,,Couldn't wait for this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:52.11,en,,0,0,0,,Always great to be out of the shadows for a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:53.74,en,,0,0,0,,The family looks beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.38,en,,0,0,0,,Let me just clean up their filth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:56.51,en,,0,0,0,,Housekeeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:15.73,en,,0,0,0,,Frankie, my boy! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:17.97,en,,0,0,0,,Still traveling by mail, Mr. Cheapo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:19.27,en,,0,0,0,,It's not a money thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:20.87,en,,0,0,0,,I have a plane phobia, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:22.61,en,,0,0,0,,I mean, at any moment, those engines could catch...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:25.71,en,,0,0,0,,Fire! Yeah, yeah. "Fire bad."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:28.01,en,,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:30.41,en,,0,0,0,,Augustus, Porridge Head, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.62,en,,0,0,0,,Does that look like Frankenstein's head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.15,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drac, buddy, what's going on with your cape there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:34.96,en,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:36.62,en,,0,0,0,,Who pinched me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.86,en,,0,0,0,,Guilty. You're irresistible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:41.09,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, very amusing, Invisible Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:43.76,en,,0,0,0,,Hello. Great to "See" You.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.10,en,,0,0,0,,Never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.57,en,,0,0,0,,Missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:51.80,en,,0,0,0,,Missed me, missed me, missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.94,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, you win. Hold this bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:56.17,en,,0,0,0,,Why am I holding bacon... Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:57.71,en,,0,0,0,,No! Get 'em off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.58,en,,0,0,0,,Here comes the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:08.02,en,,0,0,0,,Hello, Murray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:10.05,en,,0,0,0,,Drac, what's up, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:12.09,en,,0,0,0,,The sand, Murray, the sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:13.19,en,,0,0,0,,Always with the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.83,en,,0,0,0,,Wolfie! Wanda! Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:22.83,en,,0,0,0,,I love this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:24.43,en,,0,0,0,,He always bringing it full tilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.80,en,,0,0,0,,You're looking skinny, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.60,en,,0,0,0,,Now that you're just a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.84,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, you'll pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:33.64,en,,0,0,0,,So what's up, Drac?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:35.05,en,,0,0,0,,The hotel is looking off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.58,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:42.29,en,,0,0,0,,By the way, you were right about those directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:43.49,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:46.91,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I took the Tigris through the Nile,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:47.86,en,,0,0,0,,and there was absolutely no traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:55.60,en,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.20,en,,0,0,0,,Right in my lobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.04,en,,0,0,0,,Drac, I swear, man, I don't run like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.14,en,,0,0,0,,Housekeeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:11.72,en,,0,0,0,,I was not the cause of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:14.99,en,,0,0,0,,We're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.63,en,,0,0,0,,If only Martha were here to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:24.13,en,,0,0,0,,She's always here, Wanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:25.76,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:28.93,en,,0,0,0,,I am so glad you are here to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:32.20,en,,0,0,0,,Another birthday for my sweet little Mavis,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:36.61,en,,0,0,0,,and another successful year of refuge from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:42.68,en,,0,0,0,,These are recent human images our surveillance has uncovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:45.85,en,,0,0,0,,They are getting fatter so as to overpower us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.98,en,,0,0,0,,And they are wearing less clothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:50.22,en,,0,0,0,,allowing more movement to strangle us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:53.29,en,,0,0,0,,or cut open our heads and put candy in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:56.43,en,,0,0,0,,But they will never find us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:58.83,en,,0,0,0,,Evil villain, you will never win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:01.63,en,,0,0,0,,Okey-doke. The fun starts in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:03.73,en,,0,0,0,,Right now, I have to see my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.40,en,,0,0,0,,She's not so little anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:06.47,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:11.48,en,,0,0,0,,What's going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:13.38,en,,0,0,0,,Are we at the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:16.45,en,,0,0,0,,Frank, did you book us for a tandem massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:18.62,en,,0,0,0,,Did you get us a table at Hunchback's?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:19.92,en,,0,0,0,,Did you do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:22.62,en,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.55,en,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:27.38,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, you said that when I turned 118,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.73,en,,0,0,0,,I could go out into the world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:32.80,en,,0,0,0,,like every other adult that gets to come and go from this hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:35.01,en,,0,0,0,,"But, Mavey Wavey, it's not safe."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:37.70,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, 30 years ago, you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.74,en,,0,0,0,,I remember, we were both eating mice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.77,en,,0,0,0,,and you specifically said that you gave me your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:47.78,en,,0,0,0,,Do not disturb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:48.98,en,,0,0,0,,Do not disturb. Do not disturb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:50.31,en,,0,0,0,,Do not disturb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.82,en,,0,0,0,,Do not disturb. Do not disturb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:53.65,en,,0,0,0,,- Do not disturb. - Good morning, Your Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.72,en,,0,0,0,,Maid, clean up this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:10:59.92,en,,0,0,0,,It's you. Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.46,en,,0,0,0,,- Is she up yet? - Oh, she's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:06.05,en,,0,0,0,,She's ready to go. And by "Go," I mean go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:07.03,en,,0,0,0,,As in, go check the world out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:09.20,en,,0,0,0,,What you gonna do? What you gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:12.00,en,,0,0,0,,I got it covered. Please, relax. Just do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:15.54,en,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mavey Wavey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.31,en,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, my little mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:18.54,en,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.61,en,,0,0,0,,I know it's my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:21.90,en,,0,0,0,,I have so much fun planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.85,en,,0,0,0,,But first, we go catch some scorpions together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.65,en,,0,0,0,,just the two of us, yes, dead-ums?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:29.99,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, please, let me speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:31.89,en,,0,0,0,,There's something we have to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.89,0:11:33.99,en,,0,0,0,,You want to go out into the world. You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:36.86,en,,0,0,0,,I knew you were gonna say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.76,en,,0,0,0,,But, Dad, you gave me your word,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.33,en,,0,0,0,,and you know that I know that a Dracula's word is sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:42.73,en,,0,0,0,,That our trust is the core of our...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:43.90,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:45.57,en,,0,0,0,,I said you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:47.20,en,,0,0,0,,You're just playing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:49.74,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no. You're old enough to drive a hearse now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.51,en,,0,0,0,,you're old enough to make your own choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:52.84,en,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:55.61,en,,0,0,0,,Holy rabies! Holy rabies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:02.32,en,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.22,en,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, sweetfangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.72,en,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:07.86,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I'm going to Paradise,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:10.03,en,,0,0,0,,and this is just some stuff that I thought I would need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.49,en,,0,0,0,,Paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:15.00,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know. It's that place out there where you and Mom met.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:18.50,en,,0,0,0,,Auntie Wanda says you two were just like, Zing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.00,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know from "Zing."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:21.84,en,,0,0,0,,Where did you find that card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.77,en,,0,0,0,,In one of your drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.51,en,,0,0,0,,Why won't you ever tell me about how you met?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.88,en,,0,0,0,,It's actually Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.95,en,,0,0,0,,Ha-what-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:31.78,en,,0,0,0,,Look, honey, I know you're excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.30,en,,0,0,0,,but everyone has gone to great lengths
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.82,en,,0,0,0,,to come see you on your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:38.22,en,,0,0,0,,I know. They always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.86,en,,0,0,0,,But aren't I getting a little old for these parties?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:44.63,en,,0,0,0,,I love them, but I really want to see new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.30,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe meet somebody my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:50.57,en,,0,0,0,,Come on. No, no, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:53.10,en,,0,0,0,,Don't give me the pouty batface.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:55.61,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, there is a human village
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:58.31,en,,0,0,0,,just a little ways past the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:01.28,en,,0,0,0,,You could go there and be back in, like, 30 minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:04.18,en,,0,0,0,,It should be plenty for your first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:08.81,en,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not Ha-wee-wee,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:09.59,en,,0,0,0,,but I guess it's still technically out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:11.99,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.83,en,,0,0,0,,Thanks for trusting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.50,en,,0,0,0,,Of course, my little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.26,en,,0,0,0,,I gave you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.93,0:13:24.43,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:25.97,en,,0,0,0,,- Look at this! - Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:28.07,en,,0,0,0,,You excited about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.94,en,,0,0,0,,Not as excited as I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:31.07,en,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna believe this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.58,en,,0,0,0,,but Dad is letting me go out on my own to see a human village!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:34.58,en,,0,0,0,,- What? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.75,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Drac!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.08,en,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.98,en,,0,0,0,,Letting your own daughter out there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:42.29,en,,0,0,0,,with those horrible humans you always tell us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:44.59,en,,0,0,0,,That's why you built this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:46.52,en,,0,0,0,,They hate us. They're vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:48.49,en,,0,0,0,,And they're very loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:51.09,en,,0,0,0,,Auntie Eunice, maybe they've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.63,en,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna fly down the street and see how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:55.60,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, honey, be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:57.67,en,,0,0,0,,Bring warm clothes and a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.17,en,,0,0,0,,And look out for pitchforks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.24,en,,0,0,0,,Don't you let anyone scoop your brains out, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.77,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe stay in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.97,en,,0,0,0,,It's more fun to just observe from under a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:06.91,en,,0,0,0,,Guys, guys. She can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:09.15,en,,0,0,0,,She's a Dracula, for Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:11.45,en,,0,0,0,,But seriously, watch out for fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:13.18,en,,0,0,0,,Fire bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:24.73,en,,0,0,0,,Bye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.07,en,,0,0,0,,Drac,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.68,en,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how calm you are about her leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.35,en,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:44.58,en,,0,0,0,,Drac? Drac?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.22,en,,0,0,0,,Where did Drac go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.29,en,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.53,0:14:58.76,en,,0,0,0,,There's the cemetery, just like Dad said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.43,en,,0,0,0,,Uh... Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:37.93,en,,0,0,0,,Anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.75,en,,0,0,0,,- Vampire. - Bite toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.42,en,,0,0,0,,Hi, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.59,0:15:59.16,en,,0,0,0,,Everything Okay? My name is Mavis Dracula, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:00.59,en,,0,0,0,,Vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:02.36,en,,0,0,0,,- Burn clothes. - Burn my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.69,en,,0,0,0,,- Really? - Vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:08.23,en,,0,0,0,,- We take your candy. - Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:10.70,en,,0,0,0,,I'm friendly. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:12.77,en,,0,0,0,,- Calm down, now. - Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:14.57,en,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:35.36,en,,0,0,0,,Please. I've never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:37.53,en,,0,0,0,,I'm homeschooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.30,en,,0,0,0,,Is that garlic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.01,en,,0,0,0,,Holy rabies, you're on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.51,en,,0,0,0,,Can I do anything? Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.21,en,,0,0,0,,Dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.22,en,,0,0,0,,Dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.43,en,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:14.20,en,,0,0,0,,Now my baby will be safe forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.94,en,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, get back to work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.81,en,,0,0,0,,You don't need a mannequin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.38,en,,0,0,0,,Leave the mannequin here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.27,en,,0,0,0,,Where you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.10,en,,0,0,0,,Why you sneaking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:55.51,en,,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:59.18,en,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, have you returned so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.61,en,,0,0,0,,Oh. Come in, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:02.65,en,,0,0,0,,How'd it go? How was the big world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:04.21,en,,0,0,0,,How was it out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.72,en,,0,0,0,,It was okay, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.28,en,,0,0,0,,What? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:09.09,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:10.79,en,,0,0,0,,Humans are awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.69,en,,0,0,0,,They were everything you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.09,en,,0,0,0,,- They wanted to bite my toes. - Your toes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:16.86,en,,0,0,0,,And they had garlic on bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:19.23,en,,0,0,0,,What? Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:22.33,en,,0,0,0,,I'm getting goose bumps, I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:26.80,en,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:29.44,en,,0,0,0,,I hate that you had to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:31.57,en,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:36.18,en,,0,0,0,,I'll never leave here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:39.92,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:44.39,en,,0,0,0,,Look, Daddy's going to make you the bestest birthday ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.76,en,,0,0,0,,Look what I brought you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:47.46,en,,0,0,0,,Your wormcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:51.39,en,,0,0,0,,Don't be sad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:52.29,en,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:55.63,en,,0,0,0,,this is the year we open Mommy's present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.07,en,,0,0,0,,What did she get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:18:58.60,en,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:02.77,en,,0,0,0,,She said never to open until you're 118.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:04.74,en,,0,0,0,,We've waited this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.28,en,,0,0,0,,You eat your wormcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:09.05,en,,0,0,0,,You come down whenever you're ready, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.48,en,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:15.65,en,,0,0,0,,What I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.76,en,,0,0,0,,She'll thank me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:21.76,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what the guy who shrunk my head said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.71,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, what do you want, a cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:37.81,en,,0,0,0,,You did all right, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:39.04,en,,0,0,0,,Move on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:46.05,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:50.79,en,,0,0,0,,Vampire! Vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:51.79,en,,0,0,0,,A human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:57.09,en,,0,0,0,,Who are you? And how did you find this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:58.73,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:00.70,en,,0,0,0,,And I was just mountain climbing with some dudes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.10,en,,0,0,0,,and heard this story about a spooky forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.61,en,,0,0,0,,And who's not going to go into a spooky forest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:15.21,en,,0,0,0,,So, then I see these goofy-looking dudes on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:21.65,en,,0,0,0,,And I just kind of followed them to this, like, amazing castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:25.32,en,,0,0,0,,But, of course, be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:28.69,en,,0,0,0,,No bonfires, no firework shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:31.09,en,,0,0,0,,- How many of you are there? - Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.90,en,,0,0,0,,I like to hit it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.90,en,,0,0,0,,You meet so many awesome people in the youth hostels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:38.77,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, speaking of awesome, that cape thing is killing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:40.34,en,,0,0,0,,Is there, like, a costume party here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.74,en,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:43.24,en,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.17,en,,0,0,0,,You have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:47.68,en,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.15,en,,0,0,0,,One of your piranhas in the lake is very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:51.88,en,,0,0,0,,He ate my sister-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:54.18,en,,0,0,0,,Be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:57.29,en,,0,0,0,,Mr. Dracula, we asked for a room with a view of the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:59.16,en,,0,0,0,,The room's fine. We want to book a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:00.22,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, Swedish. Shiatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:01.82,en,,0,0,0,,Aromatherapy. Lower back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:03.09,en,,0,0,0,,Do you have hot-stone? We want a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:04.59,en,,0,0,0,,- I'll get back to you, Mr. Hydraberg. - I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.23,en,,0,0,0,,I doubt it. See that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.23,0:21:08.26,en,,0,0,0,,That's Ms. Hydraberg. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:10.13,en,,0,0,0,,- Yes, nice to see you. - Dude, seriously, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:11.73,en,,0,0,0,,It's kind of funky to breathe under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:14.30,en,,0,0,0,,Drac. Drac. How'd it go with Mavey?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.31,0:21:16.47,en,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.68,en,,0,0,0,,This room's kind of small for a big castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:25.21,en,,0,0,0,,No bed, but check out these awesome dustpans they give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:27.02,en,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:28.95,en,,0,0,0,,What weapons are you keeping in this container?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:30.45,en,,0,0,0,,Your pitchforks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:33.99,en,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.66,en,,0,0,0,,It's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:38.43,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely due for a fluff and fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:39.36,en,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:40.86,en,,0,0,0,,A torture device?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.87,0:21:42.60,en,,0,0,0,,A secret mind controller?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:44.43,en,,0,0,0,,You won't read my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:45.84,en,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:47.30,en,,0,0,0,,Dude, it's just music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:48.97,en,,0,0,0,,Here, try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.54,en,,0,0,0,,It's taking my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.88,en,,0,0,0,,What? It's a good jam. Don't be a grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:01.05,en,,0,0,0,,You need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:03.77,en,,0,0,0,,No human has ever entered this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:05.92,en,,0,0,0,,And if someone should see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:09.06,en,,0,0,0,,the safety of the hotel, the sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.39,en,,0,0,0,,no one would ever come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:13.43,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:15.80,en,,0,0,0,,"Ever come again!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:19.40,en,,0,0,0,,I love your Dracula voice. It's so over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:21.46,en,,0,0,0,,And Mavis, if she saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.84,en,,0,0,0,,she would know that I lied. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.68,en,,0,0,0,,Who's Mavis? Is this her room?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.38,en,,0,0,0,,I'm good with a roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:29.05,en,,0,0,0,,I had six brothers growing up, so I could totally share.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.51,en,,0,0,0,,I can't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:32.65,en,,0,0,0,,It would set monsters back hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.65,0:22:34.48,en,,0,0,0,,One time, in Hamburg, I roomed with this dude
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:36.35,en,,0,0,0,,who I caught stealing my shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:37.36,en,,0,0,0,,I said, "Whoa, man," And
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.36,0:22:39.26,en,,0,0,0,,he threw a flower pot at me, but he was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:40.69,en,,0,0,0,,What are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:42.39,en,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:43.93,en,,0,0,0,,Check out these awesome costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.93,0:22:47.10,en,,0,0,0,,Costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:50.07,en,,0,0,0,,What's this? Sorry, man. I just can't be without my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:51.82,en,,0,0,0,,You know, everything I own's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:52.30,en,,0,0,0,,It'll be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:55.24,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, I just... I love my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:56.71,en,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:22:58.54,en,,0,0,0,,What are you... What are you doing to my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:01.04,en,,0,0,0,,Stop. Wait, that tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.05,0:23:03.01,en,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:09.12,en,,0,0,0,,Check it out. I'm a Franken-homie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:11.35,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello. Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:13.62,en,,0,0,0,,This is totally normal, not a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:15.26,en,,0,0,0,,This is just a monster with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:17.79,en,,0,0,0,,Man, everybody stepped it up tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:20.46,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are we going to the front door? Are we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:22.73,en,,0,0,0,,Bonjour,Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:24.53,en,,0,0,0,,Sniffy. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:26.30,en,,0,0,0,,Not right now, Quasimodo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:30.34,en,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.34,0:23:32.44,en,,0,0,0,,No. Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:35.24,en,,0,0,0,,It's not a human, but Monsieur Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:36.91,en,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.42,0:23:41.02,en,,0,0,0,,Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.02,0:23:43.62,en,,0,0,0,,- The devilled lizard fingers. - Devilled lizard fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.62,0:23:45.35,en,,0,0,0,,I asked for spleens-in-blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:47.46,en,,0,0,0,,You ugly fool! I told you, he doesn't like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.46,0:23:48.92,en,,0,0,0,,- the lizard fingers! - But you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.73,0:23:53.56,en,,0,0,0,,Check that costume out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:55.78,en,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I just have to ask you:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.78,0:23:57.63,en,,0,0,0,,How are you pulling this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:59.50,en,,0,0,0,,I mean, it looks so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.40,en,,0,0,0,,Like, I could just put my hand right through...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.64,0:24:04.57,en,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:08.34,en,,0,0,0,,She's real. You're real!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.35,0:24:10.07,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I'll give you a real beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.07,0:24:11.45,en,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands out of my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:16.89,en,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:57.56,en,,0,0,0,,Honey, I just didn't know where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.56,0:24:59.86,en,,0,0,0,,We thought you were still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.86,0:25:02.33,en,,0,0,0,,No. I don't know why I ever wanted to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.33,0:25:04.00,en,,0,0,0,,The humans are so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.61,0:25:19.75,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis, honey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.75,0:25:22.82,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so. That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:24.85,en,,0,0,0,,My head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:26.72,en,,0,0,0,,- Who is that? - Who is what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.72,0:25:28.36,en,,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:30.43,en,,0,0,0,,That is nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.43,0:25:32.70,en,,0,0,0,,- Seriously, Dad? - "Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.70,0:25:36.07,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, Dracula's daughter. Everyone freaks out at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.07,0:25:37.37,en,,0,0,0,,Dracula?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.37,0:25:38.43,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, we got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.51,0:25:44.47,en,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me. I'm so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.48,0:25:47.01,en,,0,0,0,,I have so many places I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.01,0:25:49.08,en,,0,0,0,,I've got tickets to six Dave Matthews Band concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:50.95,en,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.22,0:25:55.92,en,,0,0,0,,Shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:58.55,en,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for me to think with all your noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:00.42,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Glen. Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.66,0:26:05.52,en,,0,0,0,,Wait. Aren't you going to suck my blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:07.13,en,,0,0,0,,Classic human paranoia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.13,0:26:10.83,en,,0,0,0,,Human blood is so fatty, and you never know where it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:13.67,en,,0,0,0,,So, Dracula doesn't drink blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.67,0:26:16.51,en,,0,0,0,,No, I use a blood substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.51,0:26:18.77,en,,0,0,0,,Either Near Blood or Blood Beaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.77,0:26:20.71,en,,0,0,0,,You can't tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.71,0:26:23.58,en,,0,0,0,,So, you're, like, the real Count Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:26.58,en,,0,0,0,,Like, "I'm Dracula. Bleh, bleh-bleh."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.58,0:26:30.12,en,,0,0,0,,I've never said that in my life. Bleh, bleh-bleh
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:32.22,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know where that comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:35.36,en,,0,0,0,,Can I just ask, what exactly is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.36,0:26:37.63,en,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.07,0:26:46.17,en,,0,0,0,,It's a place I built for all those monsters out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.17,0:26:51.61,en,,0,0,0,,lurking in the shadows, hiding from the persecution of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.61,0:26:56.01,en,,0,0,0,,A place for them and their families to come to and be themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.01,0:26:59.42,en,,0,0,0,,A place void of torches, pitchforks, angry mobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.42,0:27:02.52,en,,0,0,0,,A place of peace, relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.52,0:27:05.09,en,,0,0,0,,and tranquility.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.09,0:27:06.86,en,,0,0,0,,Cool. So, it's like a hotel for monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.26,0:27:11.83,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly. "A hotel for monsters." Way to sum it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.30,0:27:16.57,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, hop on my back. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.57,0:27:18.50,en,,0,0,0,,You're a bat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:20.90,en,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to fly. What's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:23.84,en,,0,0,0,,This is insane. Wait. Wait, I want to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.84,0:27:24.94,en,,0,0,0,,Can Frankenstein sign my costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.94,0:27:26.34,en,,0,0,0,,Can I meet the Invisible Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.34,0:27:28.74,en,,0,0,0,,If I stuck my hand in the Invisible Man's mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.75,0:27:30.51,en,,0,0,0,,would it disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:34.35,en,,0,0,0,,Mavey! What are you doing, my sweet little blood orange?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.35,0:27:36.52,en,,0,0,0,,Our friend was just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.52,0:27:38.12,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was flying me out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:41.06,en,,0,0,0,,This guy, he's so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.06,0:27:43.93,en,,0,0,0,,Look, you have something on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.93,0:27:47.13,en,,0,0,0,,Play along if you ever want to see your precious backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.47,0:27:51.93,en,,0,0,0,,So, wait, you didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.93,0:27:54.17,en,,0,0,0,,have any clothes on when you were a bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:55.47,en,,0,0,0,,Or were they bat-sized?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.47,0:27:57.31,en,,0,0,0,,Who exactly is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.51,0:27:59.98,en,,0,0,0,,Honeybat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.98,0:28:02.68,en,,0,0,0,,You see, it's your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.68,0:28:05.46,en,,0,0,0,,And you know I want you to have the bestest,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.46,0:28:07.35,en,,0,0,0,,specialest party of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.35,0:28:10.45,en,,0,0,0,,So, We... I needed some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:12.05,en,,0,0,0,,You needed help?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:15.93,en,,0,0,0,,Look, I am very good, but I thought it would be
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.93,0:28:17.88,en,,0,0,0,,even more bestest, specialest if
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.88,0:28:20.86,en,,0,0,0,,someone closer to your age helped plan the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.87,0:28:22.20,en,,0,0,0,,- You're my age? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:23.83,en,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.83,0:28:25.10,en,,0,0,0,,118.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:26.80,en,,0,0,0,,One hundred and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.80,0:28:29.84,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm 121.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.84,0:28:31.84,en,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.84,0:28:35.84,en,,0,0,0,,You see? Everything is very, very normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.85,0:28:38.38,en,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a party, and he's helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:41.18,en,,0,0,0,,- Sir, there's an emergency. - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.19,0:28:44.52,en,,0,0,0,,Can't you see we're in the middle of something very normal here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:46.59,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.59,0:28:48.80,en,,0,0,0,,There's an emergency in your precious hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.80,0:28:50.46,en,,0,0,0,,and you're not running to fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.46,0:28:51.89,en,,0,0,0,,Why? Is it because of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.90,0:28:55.06,en,,0,0,0,,Look at my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.07,0:28:58.40,en,,0,0,0,,No, precious bones, it's not because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:29:00.94,en,,0,0,0,,Good. Then go check on the emergency, and I'll keep him company.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.94,0:29:04.04,en,,0,0,0,,- No! Anything but that! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:07.01,en,,0,0,0,,I mean, because he needs time to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:09.65,en,,0,0,0,,And if you're keeping him company, then he's not planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.65,0:29:11.78,en,,0,0,0,,He is company-keeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.78,0:29:13.82,en,,0,0,0,,and then the plan, it's... It doesn't get planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.02,0:29:16.72,en,,0,0,0,,- Good one. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.72,0:29:20.72,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. So, maybe if you're not planning later, we can hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.73,0:29:23.23,en,,0,0,0,,- Sounds good. - Yes. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.23,0:29:25.29,en,,0,0,0,,It sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:28.96,en,,0,0,0,,So you will hang out. See you later, my honey. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.83,0:29:31.63,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're not hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.64,0:29:33.67,en,,0,0,0,,Because you are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.67,0:29:35.64,en,,0,0,0,,But the opposite, you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.28,0:29:41.18,en,,0,0,0,,But, sir, the emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.18,0:29:42.41,en,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.42,0:29:49.12,en,,0,0,0,,Boy, that kid smelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.39,0:29:54.82,en,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.83,0:29:56.46,en,,0,0,0,,Just getting rid of you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.46,0:29:59.19,en,,0,0,0,,through a secret tunnel so she does not see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.20,0:30:01.76,en,,0,0,0,,So, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.77,0:30:04.13,en,,0,0,0,,Is that real, about the garlic thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.14,0:30:07.24,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, I cannot have it. My throat swells.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.24,0:30:08.97,en,,0,0,0,,Wooden stake to the heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.97,0:30:10.27,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, who wouldn't that kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.95,0:30:21.92,en,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.99,0:30:28.06,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm a little lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.06,0:30:30.53,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know it's your honeymoon. I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.53,0:30:33.33,en,,0,0,0,,Go back to doing what you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.94,0:30:39.44,en,,0,0,0,,I'm not down here much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.44,0:30:43.31,en,,0,0,0,,It's meant to be an exit if humans ever invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.31,0:30:45.53,en,,0,0,0,,So, I'm, like, the first human here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.53,0:30:46.44,en,,0,0,0,,That's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.61,0:30:49.31,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.31,0:30:51.11,en,,0,0,0,,I think this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.25,0:30:56.45,en,,0,0,0,,- What's happening? - I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.45,0:30:57.55,en,,0,0,0,,- My mistake. - What is wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.26,0:31:03.63,en,,0,0,0,,This place is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.63,0:31:05.99,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, I could really use some silence right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.00,0:31:14.90,en,,0,0,0,,All right, third time's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.81,0:31:23.18,en,,0,0,0,,Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.95,0:31:25.48,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, Frankie?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.48,0:31:26.68,en,,0,0,0,,Buddy, what you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:28.12,en,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.12,0:31:30.22,en,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. What you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:33.29,en,,0,0,0,,We wanted to practice our big number for Mavis's party,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.29,0:31:35.06,en,,0,0,0,,and then these losers wouldn't get off the bandstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.06,0:31:36.89,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Put down Zombie Mozart,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.89,0:31:38.16,en,,0,0,0,,Bach and Beethoven this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:46.00,en,,0,0,0,,Did you get to rehearse at all, Zombie Beethoven?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.01,0:31:51.84,en,,0,0,0,,Listen, Drac, we wanted to play something, like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:54.54,en,,0,0,0,,We even thought maybe you'd sing with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.55,0:31:56.15,en,,0,0,0,,Come on, fellas. You know
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.15,0:31:58.91,en,,0,0,0,,that I haven't sung in public since Martha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.92,0:31:59.85,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we just thought how much,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.85,0:32:00.65,en,,0,0,0,,you know, Mavis would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.65,0:32:01.88,en,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.89,0:32:04.09,en,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.09,0:32:07.22,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now, let's hug the zombies. Let's all make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.22,0:32:09.56,en,,0,0,0,,- He really scared you. - I wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.56,0:32:11.76,en,,0,0,0,,I was being polite, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:14.73,en,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here? I thought you were planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.73,0:32:17.13,en,,0,0,0,,I never caught your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.13,0:32:18.40,en,,0,0,0,,My name's Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.40,0:32:21.04,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis? That's a pretty neat name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:23.14,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my mom picked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.14,0:32:26.28,en,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to tell me your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.28,0:32:30.28,en,,0,0,0,,Me? My name? Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.28,0:32:32.51,en,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I'm Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.52,0:32:35.08,en,,0,0,0,,No, you're not. Frankenstein is my uncle over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.09,0:32:36.92,en,,0,0,0,,The gentleman hugging Zombie Mozart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.82,0:32:40.86,en,,0,0,0,,Right. Of course, he's your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.86,0:32:43.99,en,,0,0,0,,See, I'm not "The" Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.99,0:32:47.63,en,,0,0,0,,I'm his cousin, Johnnystein.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.63,0:32:49.03,en,,0,0,0,,- Johnnystein? - Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.77,0:32:55.44,en,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.44,0:32:57.17,en,,0,0,0,,Are these monsters going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.17,0:32:59.04,en,,0,0,0,,Not as long as they think you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.04,0:33:00.58,en,,0,0,0,,That's kind of racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.58,0:33:01.91,en,,0,0,0,,We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.72,0:33:08.22,en,,0,0,0,,- Is he making fun of me? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.22,0:33:10.35,en,,0,0,0,,Of course he's not, because he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.35,0:33:12.02,en,,0,0,0,,he's your cousin, Johnnystein.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.02,0:33:13.89,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.89,0:33:15.59,en,,0,0,0,,I don't have no cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.59,0:33:18.43,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, you do. He's your sixth cousin, three times removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:20.53,en,,0,0,0,,On your right arm's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.53,0:33:21.93,en,,0,0,0,,You have a cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.93,0:33:23.50,en,,0,0,0,,Frank, if your arm could talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:24.54,en,,0,0,0,,he would tell you that the
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.54,0:33:26.17,en,,0,0,0,,original owner of your arm had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.17,0:33:27.74,en,,0,0,0,,Who married a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:30.01,en,,0,0,0,,Who was... for strangling a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.01,0:33:32.24,en,,0,0,0,,I have pig-strangling blood in my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:33.44,en,,0,0,0,,That's kind of cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.44,0:33:35.21,en,,0,0,0,,Cuz, great to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.41,0:33:39.15,en,,0,0,0,,So, what brings you here, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:40.68,en,,0,0,0,,- What was that? - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.68,0:33:43.02,en,,0,0,0,,I should really clear my throat before I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:44.59,en,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.86,0:33:47.92,en,,0,0,0,,Party planner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.93,0:33:49.72,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have recruited Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.72,0:33:53.30,en,,0,0,0,,Stein here to help me with Mavis's birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:55.93,en,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you asked someone to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:57.17,en,,0,0,0,,Captain Control Freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.17,0:33:58.77,en,,0,0,0,,It's Count...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.77,0:34:02.60,en,,0,0,0,,And yes, I thought having a Mavis contemporary would be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.61,0:34:06.64,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he totally needed a fresher perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.64,0:34:09.01,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, Johnny, Mr. Tight Coffin over here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.01,0:34:11.25,en,,0,0,0,,was planning to have these powdered lame-os play at the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.22,0:34:16.52,en,,0,0,0,,So, anyways, we thought we could liven things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.52,0:34:19.39,en,,0,0,0,,You all play? Let's check you guys out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.43,0:34:25.69,en,,0,0,0,,Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.70,0:34:29.20,en,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's your big night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.27,0:34:37.41,en,,0,0,0,,Seems like only yesterday you were eating mosquitoes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.41,0:34:40.18,en,,0,0,0,,But now you're eating frogs and mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.18,0:34:44.65,en,,0,0,0,,Scarfing them down like Doritos
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.65,0:34:46.25,en,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.25,0:34:50.02,en,,0,0,0,,Where did the time go, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.02,0:34:51.45,en,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:53.06,en,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.06,0:34:54.59,en,,0,0,0,,That's cute, but kind of old school.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.59,0:34:56.46,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.46,0:34:59.06,en,,0,0,0,,You got to totally tempo things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.06,0:35:00.93,en,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:03.67,en,,0,0,0,,Werewolf man, give me a jam!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.67,0:35:05.03,en,,0,0,0,,2, 3, 4
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:07.40,en,,0,0,0,,Vampire girl with the fangy fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.40,0:35:09.77,en,,0,0,0,,Hair real cute with the bangy bangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.77,0:35:12.01,en,,0,0,0,,Little princess gonna be a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.01,0:35:14.01,en,,0,0,0,,Legal bat lady turning 118.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.91,0:35:18.98,en,,0,0,0,,118! Say 118!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.98,0:35:20.18,en,,0,0,0,,118!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.18,0:35:22.35,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Stage dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:27.76,en,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.76,0:35:29.42,en,,0,0,0,,I am so blown away right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.43,0:35:32.89,en,,0,0,0,,I think my cuz is gonna make this
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.90,0:35:36.47,en,,0,0,0,,the best party ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.47,0:35:38.63,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Maybe he can find a way to get me some chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.64,0:35:40.24,en,,0,0,0,,We should do a dance contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.24,0:35:42.07,en,,0,0,0,,We're not doing any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:43.94,en,,0,0,0,,We've got to stay on schedule, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.94,0:35:45.64,en,,0,0,0,,All right, Dad, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:47.44,en,,0,0,0,,- Johnny, you're coming, too. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.44,0:35:48.78,en,,0,0,0,,- Is it cool with Dracula? - Johnny, come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.49,0:35:58.89,en,,0,0,0,,N-27.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.89,0:36:01.22,en,,0,0,0,,N-27.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.80,0:36:14.07,en,,0,0,0,,G-61.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.07,0:36:15.67,en,,0,0,0,,G-61.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.27,0:36:20.18,en,,0,0,0,,Bingo! Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.18,0:36:21.54,en,,0,0,0,,How dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.55,0:36:23.55,en,,0,0,0,,Do you know what doctor made me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.55,0:36:24.65,en,,0,0,0,,I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.98,0:36:28.38,en,,0,0,0,,Circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.39,0:36:29.75,en,,0,0,0,,Fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.85,0:36:33.32,en,,0,0,0,,Hands? Film.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.42,0:36:36.26,en,,0,0,0,,Vomit. The Vomit?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.26,0:36:39.06,en,,0,0,0,,- The Throw Up. - No. That wasn't a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.67,0:36:48.04,en,,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.04,0:36:49.94,en,,0,0,0,,Emptiness? Glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:52.41,en,,0,0,0,,Glasses? Glasses shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:54.14,en,,0,0,0,,Glasses shaking sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:56.14,en,,0,0,0,,Through The Looking-Glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.15,0:36:58.58,en,,0,0,0,,I stink at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.01,0:37:31.41,en,,0,0,0,,I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.42,0:37:35.12,en,,0,0,0,,And pull it back. And up. And push.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.12,0:37:37.49,en,,0,0,0,,And twist. And back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.49,0:37:39.75,en,,0,0,0,,And up. And twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.76,0:37:40.89,en,,0,0,0,,And push.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:46.56,en,,0,0,0,,No. Don't copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:49.60,en,,0,0,0,,And back. And up. And twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.37,0:37:56.20,en,,0,0,0,,Let me get a bubonic moose nose omelet
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.21,0:37:58.37,en,,0,0,0,,with cockroach paste and mouse jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.38,0:37:59.88,en,,0,0,0,,And with egg whites.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.48,0:38:03.85,en,,0,0,0,,Bonjour, Monsieur Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.85,0:38:05.41,en,,0,0,0,,May I make you an omelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.42,0:38:06.88,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no. I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.72,0:38:11.22,en,,0,0,0,,What? Esmeralda, you smell it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.22,0:38:12.69,en,,0,0,0,,- Human? - I am hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.56,0:38:17.03,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny, you've been to the Taj Mahal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.03,0:38:19.53,en,,0,0,0,,Come on. No monster's been to the Taj.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.53,0:38:22.13,en,,0,0,0,,Man, I wish I could go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:23.70,en,,0,0,0,,You know what? I'll take 50 omelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.60,en,,0,0,0,,You heard the man! Make them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.14,0:38:30.67,en,,0,0,0,,How did you deal with the mobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.67,0:38:32.87,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does get pretty crazy in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:34.84,en,,0,0,0,,But, you know, you just got to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.85,0:38:37.25,en,,0,0,0,,He just rolls. That's cool that he rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.25,0:38:39.15,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.15,0:38:40.85,en,,0,0,0,,Look, love droppings, I brought
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.86,0:38:43.39,en,,0,0,0,,you a bagel with your favorite scream cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.39,0:38:45.12,en,,0,0,0,,Holy rabies. Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.12,0:38:46.66,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny, try some scream cheese, it's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.66,0:38:48.09,en,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.09,0:38:52.06,en,,0,0,0,,But I'm scream cheese intolerant. So, polite pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.06,0:38:53.76,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.76,0:38:57.07,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny, can we party-plan talk for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.07,0:38:58.63,en,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.64,0:39:00.57,en,,0,0,0,,If they find out you are human, they'll go bat poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.57,0:39:03.34,en,,0,0,0,,Relax. No one suspects anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.34,0:39:04.12,en,,0,0,0,,The only thing that looks
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.12,0:39:05.44,en,,0,0,0,,weird is how much whispering you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.04,0:39:09.18,en,,0,0,0,,Just wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.18,0:39:11.28,en,,0,0,0,,You will say you are going in the pool and act excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.28,0:39:14.35,en,,0,0,0,,And then you will say you hurt your back and you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.02,0:39:19.49,en,,0,0,0,,Here come good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.49,0:39:21.06,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, dudes. Oh, my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.06,0:39:22.66,en,,0,0,0,,I'm on your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.66,0:39:24.53,en,,0,0,0,,No, no. He said, "Oh, my back."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.53,0:39:27.03,en,,0,0,0,,- Get on my back! - Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.03,0:39:30.10,en,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Chicken fight! Push them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:32.27,en,,0,0,0,,Chicken fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.34,0:39:34.54,en,,0,0,0,,We got you, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.54,0:39:36.14,en,,0,0,0,,You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.14,0:39:38.94,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, we'll see, "Mavey Wavey."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.38,0:39:44.71,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, calm down with the fight chickens!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.72,0:39:46.85,en,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stop the roughhousing!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.42,0:39:55.92,en,,0,0,0,,Frank, if you hurt yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.93,0:39:57.73,en,,0,0,0,,I got it, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.73,0:40:00.16,en,,0,0,0,,The Stein boys are bred for this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.16,0:40:01.60,en,,0,0,0,,Geronimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.11,0:40:15.74,en,,0,0,0,,Kids, why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.41,0:40:17.78,en,,0,0,0,,I was just in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.78,0:40:18.95,en,,0,0,0,,The water's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.95,0:40:20.28,en,,0,0,0,,Don't judge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.58,0:40:23.85,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny. Your makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.85,0:40:25.69,en,,0,0,0,,Your makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.69,0:40:26.72,en,,0,0,0,,Climb out. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.32,0:40:30.03,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.03,0:40:32.33,en,,0,0,0,,I guess the Count wanted to go for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.57,0:40:47.74,en,,0,0,0,,Cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.97,0:41:16.40,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, you messed up, baby. You messed up big-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.41,0:41:18.57,en,,0,0,0,,I told you to take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.58,0:41:20.48,en,,0,0,0,,You'll ruin my hotel if they find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.48,0:41:21.91,en,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you're just jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.91,0:41:23.48,en,,0,0,0,,that people are finally having fun at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.48,0:41:26.25,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, that? That was not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.25,0:41:28.10,en,,0,0,0,,Everyone running,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.10,0:41:29.42,en,,0,0,0,,jumping, swimming with no order.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.42,0:41:30.92,en,,0,0,0,,That was the opposite of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.92,0:41:32.52,en,,0,0,0,,Do you even know what fun is?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.52,0:41:34.39,en,,0,0,0,,I invented fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.39,0:41:36.09,en,,0,0,0,,Boy, the wrong people get to be immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.49,0:41:39.43,en,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.43,0:41:44.13,en,,0,0,0,,You remember nothing of this encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.13,0:41:49.60,en,,0,0,0,,You have no memory of this place or the monsters you met.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.61,0:41:52.64,en,,0,0,0,,Now go and never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.04,0:41:56.58,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, never return to the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.58,0:41:58.95,en,,0,0,0,,What? You were supposed to forget the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.95,0:42:01.08,en,,0,0,0,,I just used my powers to erase your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.08,0:42:02.82,en,,0,0,0,,I looked straight into your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.82,0:42:04.99,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe it's the contact lenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.99,0:42:06.99,en,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.99,0:42:08.19,en,,0,0,0,,These little plasticky doodads that help me see better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.19,0:42:10.59,en,,0,0,0,,Here, let me just try and get them out real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.59,0:42:13.19,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, that is the most disgusting thing I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.20,0:42:14.68,en,,0,0,0,,Almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.68,0:42:16.16,en,,0,0,0,,Stop doing that. Please stop doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.17,0:42:19.63,en,,0,0,0,,Fingers away from the eyeballs! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:24.14,en,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. You are never to return here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.14,0:42:27.94,en,,0,0,0,,You are to stay away and never tell humans about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.94,0:42:32.71,en,,0,0,0,,Or I will track you down and suck every ounce of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.72,0:42:36.62,en,,0,0,0,,from your body until you look like a deflated whoopee cushion!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.75,0:42:40.62,en,,0,0,0,,Be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:49.63,en,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I'm leaving, man. That could have been so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.63,0:42:52.70,en,,0,0,0,,Dude ruined everything. Suck my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.70,0:42:55.54,en,,0,0,0,,I should have just said, "I'm staying, old man!"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.54,0:42:58.81,en,,0,0,0,,Give him a Bruce Lee kick. Boom! Right in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.81,0:42:59.84,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Count Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.84,0:43:01.71,en,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me. I'm leaving, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.21,0:43:05.64,en,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.64,0:43:08.33,en,,0,0,0,,Oh. No, no, Mavis, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.33,0:43:09.32,en,,0,0,0,,I have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.32,0:43:11.59,en,,0,0,0,,- You sure? It'll be fun. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:24.20,en,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna see me, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.65,0:43:42.42,en,,0,0,0,,Wow, would you look at the view from up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.42,0:43:44.14,en,,0,0,0,,You could almost see Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.15,0:43:44.72,en,,0,0,0,,Who-da-pest?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.72,0:43:47.26,en,,0,0,0,,Is that near Ha-wi-fi?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.26,0:43:50.83,en,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, you mean Hawaii. Yeah, that place is a knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.83,0:43:52.69,en,,0,0,0,,I just went to a music festival there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.70,0:43:54.63,en,,0,0,0,,A human music festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.63,0:43:57.13,en,,0,0,0,,Uh, I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.13,0:43:58.17,en,,0,0,0,,So, did they all bite your toes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.17,0:43:59.80,en,,0,0,0,,and shove garlic bread in your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.80,0:44:02.04,en,,0,0,0,,No. Well, one dude took a bigger bite
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.04,0:44:03.67,en,,0,0,0,,out of my energy bar than I expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.67,0:44:05.04,en,,0,0,0,,but I blame that on the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.04,0:44:07.78,en,,0,0,0,,It's amazing. You've been everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.78,0:44:10.28,en,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, what's the alternative?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.28,0:44:12.22,en,,0,0,0,,Just staying at home, never exploring,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.22,0:44:13.75,en,,0,0,0,,never seeing what's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.75,0:44:17.13,en,,0,0,0,,I'm only gonna be 121 once, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.13,0:44:18.55,en,,0,0,0,,Got to live it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:20.99,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.59,0:44:28.00,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, man. The sunrise from here must be amaz... Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.00,0:44:29.90,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.90,0:44:31.57,en,,0,0,0,,Man, you've probably never even seen a sunrise, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.57,0:44:33.80,en,,0,0,0,,No, not really. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.80,0:44:35.00,en,,0,0,0,,Come on. I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.61,0:44:39.14,en,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.77,0:45:07.24,en,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you guys we'd have fun in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:10.17,en,,0,0,0,,Is this not the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.38,0:45:16.64,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm working up a nice sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.65,0:45:18.91,en,,0,0,0,,When's that Johnny kid gonna be done party planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.92,0:45:21.35,en,,0,0,0,,- He's a great hang. - Yeah, he's an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.35,0:45:22.34,en,,0,0,0,,And it was so nice seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.35,0:45:24.05,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis laughing and hitting it off with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.05,0:45:26.92,en,,0,0,0,,Who's hitting what off? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.92,0:45:30.06,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis could never be with someone of his kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:33.86,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry? "His kind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.86,0:45:35.80,en,,0,0,0,,You're saying our kind's not good enough for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.80,0:45:37.70,en,,0,0,0,,"Your Lordship"?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.70,0:45:39.87,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Frank,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.87,0:45:41.67,en,,0,0,0,,I didn't... I meant that she wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.67,0:45:44.71,en,,0,0,0,,be into someone with such red, curly hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.71,0:45:46.84,en,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's wrong with red, curly hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.84,0:45:48.31,en,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.31,0:45:50.45,en,,0,0,0,,I have red curly hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.45,0:45:52.08,en,,0,0,0,,Well, how was I supposed to know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.39,0:46:10.67,en,,0,0,0,,This is the most incredible thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.60,0:46:14.47,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.47,0:46:15.97,en,,0,0,0,,Look, settle down, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.97,0:46:18.87,en,,0,0,0,,This is all a moot point because Johnny, he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.88,0:46:20.64,en,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. He left?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.64,0:46:22.64,en,,0,0,0,,Yes. He decided he didn't like Mavis,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.64,0:46:23.34,en,,0,0,0,,or any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.08,0:46:29.22,en,,0,0,0,,Hmm. I guess Johnny had second thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.46,0:46:44.00,en,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you stuck around, man. You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.00,0:46:46.23,en,,0,0,0,,Bad things are coming your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.24,0:46:49.30,en,,0,0,0,,I got to get my thoughts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.31,0:46:50.74,en,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.74,0:46:52.47,en,,0,0,0,,You see these tables?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.48,0:46:55.18,en,,0,0,0,,You can spend the entire day pulling them out
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.18,0:46:57.28,en,,0,0,0,,and placing them, party planner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.28,0:46:59.45,en,,0,0,0,,Fantastic. I'm trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.45,0:47:01.18,en,,0,0,0,,Now I know how your daughter feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.93,0:47:11.86,en,,0,0,0,,Enough! Enough! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.86,0:47:13.46,en,,0,0,0,,Go to a corner, you're in a timeout!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.46,0:47:15.33,en,,0,0,0,,Timeout? I'm a grown man!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.14,0:47:25.67,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Table 57, please move to position 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.91,0:47:32.15,en,,0,0,0,,- That is cool. - Face the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.15,0:47:36.92,en,,0,0,0,,17 to 48. 16 to 47. 19 to 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:40.89,en,,0,0,0,,- Awesomeness. - Just let me do my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.89,0:47:42.79,en,,0,0,0,,29 to 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.79,0:47:44.99,en,,0,0,0,,42 to 18. 10 to 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.99,0:47:46.83,en,,0,0,0,,17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.83,0:47:48.46,en,,0,0,0,,39 to 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.47,0:47:49.83,en,,0,0,0,,36 up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.83,0:47:51.30,en,,0,0,0,,29 to 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.88,0:48:01.81,en,,0,0,0,,31 to 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.18,0:48:09.98,en,,0,0,0,,24 up!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.99,0:48:12.49,en,,0,0,0,,7 to 25. 14 to 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.50,0:48:22.26,en,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go, grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.27,0:48:24.03,en,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out, gravity face.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.80,0:48:26.63,en,,0,0,0,,Eat my dust, gray fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.64,0:48:28.40,en,,0,0,0,,56 and 43, to my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.72,0:48:42.85,en,,0,0,0,,Prepare to cry, Billy Backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.75,0:48:48.46,en,,0,0,0,,That's how we do it! Half-pipe, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.46,0:48:50.26,en,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.96,0:48:54.86,en,,0,0,0,,Yes. Keep smelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.86,0:48:59.50,en,,0,0,0,,You catch the human, and then I will make human potpie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.37,0:49:05.31,en,,0,0,0,,27, 45, 65, 76, 48
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.31,0:49:06.04,en,,0,0,0,,block his path.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.04,0:49:07.21,en,,0,0,0,,Block his path!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.79,0:49:18.62,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on now, dude man!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.62,0:49:20.42,en,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.90,0:49:29.16,en,,0,0,0,,I got you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.97,0:49:33.67,en,,0,0,0,,Do not disturb!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.67,0:49:34.60,en,,0,0,0,,People trying to sleep here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.88,0:49:49.35,en,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.35,0:49:52.35,en,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy, Sir Breaks-a-lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:58.59,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, I have to say, that was fun. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.60,0:50:02.53,en,,0,0,0,,The fun you were talking about earlier? Nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.37,0:50:05.13,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.07,0:50:09.37,en,,0,0,0,,Quasimodo!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.98,0:50:20.19,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis? Why are you still up?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.19,0:50:20.97,en,,0,0,0,,The sun is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.97,0:50:23.15,en,,0,0,0,,It could kill you, my honeyguts.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.15,0:50:25.09,en,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep. Do you know where Johnny went?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.09,0:50:26.82,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know. He...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.82,0:50:28.99,en,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.99,0:50:31.23,en,,0,0,0,,- Do you like him? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.23,0:50:34.35,en,,0,0,0,,Pfft, no. Come on, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.36,0:50:34.60,en,,0,0,0,,He's so weird and awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.60,0:50:37.40,en,,0,0,0,,It's like, are you an idiot or do you know you're adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.07,0:50:42.57,en,,0,0,0,,Eh... Hold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.57,0:50:44.34,en,,0,0,0,,Do you have a location on Quasimodo?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.34,0:50:45.01,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.01,0:50:46.31,en,,0,0,0,,They're heading through the lobby, towards the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.31,0:50:47.78,en,,0,0,0,,I need them stopped immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.78,0:50:49.44,en,,0,0,0,,- Is that clear? - Yes, quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.45,0:50:50.65,en,,0,0,0,,We are on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.72,0:50:58.59,en,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.06,0:51:04.66,en,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this? Let me pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.66,0:51:06.23,en,,0,0,0,,Quasimodo Wilson, you are coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.70,0:51:11.00,en,,0,0,0,,Why did that hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.70,0:51:18.61,en,,0,0,0,,Look, honey, there's no falling in love at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.61,0:51:19.66,en,,0,0,0,,Mom was my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.66,0:51:20.88,en,,0,0,0,,Eunice says Mom kissed you first,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.88,0:51:22.98,en,,0,0,0,,'cause you were too scared to make the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.98,0:51:24.51,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.51,0:51:26.91,en,,0,0,0,,Forget about me and Mom and kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.92,0:51:29.75,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, at some point, I'm going to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.75,0:51:31.34,en,,0,0,0,,I can't be here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.34,0:51:32.32,en,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.32,0:51:35.06,en,,0,0,0,,You're barely out of your training fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.56,0:52:10.69,en,,0,0,0,,Quasi wins again!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.69,0:52:13.76,en,,0,0,0,,When you bump with the hump, you land on your rump!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.14,0:52:23.47,en,,0,0,0,,But why all the sudden interest?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:26.04,en,,0,0,0,,Every time we used to talk about love, it was always,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.04,0:52:28.28,en,,0,0,0,,"Ooh, Dad, that's gross,"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.28,0:52:30.88,en,,0,0,0,,and "Ooh, Dad, I don't want to know about that."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.88,0:52:32.01,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.35,0:52:34.55,en,,0,0,0,,Sir, he made it into the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.55,0:52:34.98,en,,0,0,0,,He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.98,0:52:36.48,en,,0,0,0,,What do I pay you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.49,0:52:38.35,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, honey. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.56,0:52:41.62,en,,0,0,0,,He doesn't pay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.09,0:52:47.76,en,,0,0,0,,Before you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.76,0:52:50.40,en,,0,0,0,,can I please talk to my backpack one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.40,0:52:52.47,en,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave anything unresolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.47,0:52:54.90,en,,0,0,0,,Bonjour, Monsieur Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.90,0:52:56.34,en,,0,0,0,,Shut your hump hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.34,0:52:57.97,en,,0,0,0,,Now you are helping him?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.97,0:53:00.14,en,,0,0,0,,What is it with you and this human?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.14,0:53:02.44,en,,0,0,0,,He is not human. He's a Stein!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.45,0:53:04.88,en,,0,0,0,,That's right, little man, I'm a Stein!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.88,0:53:06.19,en,,0,0,0,,If he is a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.19,0:53:08.38,en,,0,0,0,,let him scare Esmeralda!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.98,0:53:10.28,en,,0,0,0,,The mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.29,0:53:12.19,en,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.79,0:53:14.42,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.67,0:53:29.34,en,,0,0,0,,A human! A human!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.34,0:53:33.44,en,,0,0,0,,Monsieur Dracula has brought a human into the...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.65,0:53:39.81,en,,0,0,0,,Esmeralda, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.36,0:53:53.89,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for saving me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.90,0:53:57.10,en,,0,0,0,,That guy's crazy! Trying to eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.10,0:53:58.99,en,,0,0,0,,That's only happened to me one other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.99,0:54:00.70,en,,0,0,0,,This weird dude at a Slipknot concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.70,0:54:03.10,en,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.02,0:54:17.18,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we at a funeral right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.19,0:54:19.45,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, no, it's your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:23.26,en,,0,0,0,,So creepy and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.26,0:54:25.63,en,,0,0,0,,Wow! I know her!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.63,0:54:28.16,en,,0,0,0,,I've seen that picture at the ruins of Lubov.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.17,0:54:29.63,en,,0,0,0,,That's my favorite castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.63,0:54:31.47,en,,0,0,0,,There's a whole legend around that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.47,0:54:32.43,en,,0,0,0,,A legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.24,0:54:35.50,en,,0,0,0,,The Lady Lubov.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.81,0:54:38.71,en,,0,0,0,,The story is that a lonely Count met her by chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.71,0:54:41.88,en,,0,0,0,,and they say that no two souls
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.88,0:54:44.28,en,,0,0,0,,were ever more meat for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.28,0:54:46.95,en,,0,0,0,,Eventually, they settld down at Castle Lubov
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.95,0:54:47.95,en,,0,0,0,,and had a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.95,0:54:51.95,en,,0,0,0,,But then, a horre tragedy happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.95,0:54:55.79,en,,0,0,0,,A fire started mysteriouy one night, and it killed both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.83,0:55:03.90,en,,0,0,0,,When I was at the castle, I could still feel their powerful love.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.90,0:55:05.40,en,,0,0,0,,They say it's as if a soul
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.40,0:55:07.77,en,,0,0,0,,is still trapped in the ruins themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.11,0:55:11.34,en,,0,0,0,,The legend is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.87,0:55:16.78,en,,0,0,0,,It was only the wife that died.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.86,0:55:29.26,en,,0,0,0,,And it was no mystery who killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.73,0:55:32.89,en,,0,0,0,,She was killed by your kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.03,0:55:35.90,en,,0,0,0,,Vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:38.08,en,,0,0,0,,Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:39.50,en,,0,0,0,,Go hide. I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.14,0:55:43.44,en,,0,0,0,,Vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.98,0:55:48.68,en,,0,0,0,,Martha!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.48,0:55:53.31,en,,0,0,0,,They are the real monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.82,0:56:05.84,en,,0,0,0,,I built this place for my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.84,0:56:07.56,en,,0,0,0,,to protect her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.56,0:56:11.47,en,,0,0,0,,As a father, you do everything to keep your family safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.47,0:56:15.27,en,,0,0,0,,even if you have to break their trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.27,0:56:19.67,en,,0,0,0,,But now, Mavis has feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.68,0:56:20.87,en,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.88,0:56:22.78,en,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.28,0:56:27.21,en,,0,0,0,,- Awesome. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.22,0:56:29.42,en,,0,0,0,,You are a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.42,0:56:31.62,en,,0,0,0,,If the world was different, maybe it would be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.55,0:56:34.52,en,,0,0,0,,Drac, this is the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.52,0:56:36.99,en,,0,0,0,,People aren't the same as they were back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.99,0:56:40.06,en,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me for certain that if we came out in the open,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.06,0:56:41.30,en,,0,0,0,,everyone would accept us?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.30,0:56:42.46,en,,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.07,0:56:47.94,en,,0,0,0,,No. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.97,0:56:50.97,en,,0,0,0,,I'll go for good this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.97,0:56:53.51,en,,0,0,0,,You can just say I had some emergency,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.51,0:56:55.98,en,,0,0,0,,or the gremlin lady ate me or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.98,0:56:57.81,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.81,0:57:00.68,en,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ruin her birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.68,0:57:03.68,en,,0,0,0,,You can sneak out after it's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.69,0:57:06.39,en,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.39,0:57:09.39,en,,0,0,0,,The last thing I wanted was to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.39,0:57:10.59,en,,0,0,0,,Or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.36,0:57:15.93,en,,0,0,0,,You know, you're not the smoothest Frankenstein,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.93,0:57:18.30,en,,0,0,0,,but you'd make a great vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.30,0:57:19.77,en,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.77,0:57:21.64,en,,0,0,0,,'Cause I think I kind of got your hypno-eyes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.64,0:57:24.20,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, here we go. Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.21,0:57:27.68,en,,0,0,0,,Beware! For you are in my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.68,0:57:29.94,en,,0,0,0,,I command you to be the werewolf man!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.38,0:57:33.75,en,,0,0,0,,I have too many kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.85,0:57:38.02,en,,0,0,0,,Someone scratch me, I have fleas.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.92,0:57:41.52,en,,0,0,0,,'Cause he's a wolf, he'd get those.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.52,0:57:43.26,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, don't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.26,0:57:44.63,en,,0,0,0,,It's not funny when you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.38,0:58:08.02,en,,0,0,0,,I didn't order a wake-up call.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.02,0:58:10.72,en,,0,0,0,,Count Dracula arranged it for all the rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.99,0:58:14.59,en,,0,0,0,,Where's the snooze button?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.59,0:58:16.42,en,,0,0,0,,There will be no snoozing. The party's today.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.45,0:58:40.45,en,,0,0,0,,Ooh, yeah, perfecto.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.06,0:58:56.90,en,,0,0,0,,Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.90,0:59:00.03,en,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's your big night
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.04,0:59:03.57,en,,0,0,0,,You ate your frogs, now the party's so right
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.34,0:59:06.87,en,,0,0,0,,Where did the time go, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.55,0:59:14.18,en,,0,0,0,,And, girl, you used to suck a binky
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.18,0:59:17.15,en,,0,0,0,,Look at you now
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.15,0:59:20.49,en,,0,0,0,,You're sucking blood right out of the cow
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.32,0:59:24.69,en,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.69,0:59:26.99,en,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Thanks for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.00,0:59:28.80,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you like my little touches?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.45,0:59:53.45,en,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.26,1:00:02.99,en,,0,0,0,,Terrific party.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.99,1:00:04.33,en,,0,0,0,,You really outdid yourself, Drac.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.33,1:00:07.03,en,,0,0,0,,Got to be the best one I've been to in 500 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.88,1:00:18.98,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry, big man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.40,1:00:41.30,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.17,en,,0,0,0,,I'm crazily scared right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.17,1:00:45.21,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.82,1:01:01.05,en,,0,0,0,,How could you? After I shared my pain with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.06,1:01:02.96,en,,0,0,0,,- But, no... - Dad, it was just a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.96,1:01:04.59,en,,0,0,0,,No, you're not allowed to kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.59,1:01:06.61,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm allowed to do things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.61,1:01:08.30,en,,0,0,0,,I'm not 83 anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.30,1:01:10.40,en,,0,0,0,,I'm allowed to like people, or go see the world again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.40,1:01:12.06,en,,0,0,0,,What? You saw it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.06,1:01:13.27,en,,0,0,0,,You said you didn't like it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.27,1:01:15.24,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe I want to give the village another chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.24,1:01:16.42,en,,0,0,0,,I just need to learn, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.43,1:01:18.07,en,,0,0,0,,just how to roll with it, like Johnny does.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.07,1:01:21.11,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, you can't go to the village again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.11,1:01:22.51,en,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can make them see that we could be friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.51,1:01:24.51,en,,0,0,0,,No, that isn't possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.51,1:01:26.61,en,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't be sure. It's all in how you present yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.62,1:01:27.97,en,,0,0,0,,No, that won't make a difference!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.97,1:01:28.58,en,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:29.18,en,,0,0,0,,Because it just won't!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.18,1:01:29.92,en,,0,0,0,,Why? Why won't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.92,1:01:32.05,en,,0,0,0,,Because that village doesn't really exist!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.26,1:01:40.09,en,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "Doesn't exist"?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.10,1:01:41.80,en,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.80,1:01:44.23,en,,0,0,0,,I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.23,1:01:45.83,en,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.83,1:01:48.94,en,,0,0,0,,What exactly did you have to do? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.11,1:01:56.38,en,,0,0,0,,I... I built the town. The staff put it all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.38,1:02:00.21,en,,0,0,0,,The zombies dressed up as the townspeople.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.28,1:02:04.65,en,,0,0,0,,Please. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.65,1:02:07.92,en,,0,0,0,,If you really went out there and something happened to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.92,1:02:10.76,en,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.76,1:02:15.20,en,,0,0,0,,But you can live with this? Lying to me? Tricking me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.20,1:02:16.63,en,,0,0,0,,Keeping me here forever
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.63,1:02:17.80,en,,0,0,0,,when you knew my dream was to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.27,1:02:21.37,en,,0,0,0,,Liar! Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.37,1:02:23.87,en,,0,0,0,,Oil?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.24,1:02:28.78,en,,0,0,0,,English, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.78,1:02:30.88,en,,0,0,0,,Your voice is really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.88,1:02:32.71,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, I speak frozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.72,1:02:36.18,en,,0,0,0,,He says, "Dracula has brought a human into the hotel."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.72,1:02:39.35,en,,0,0,0,,- A human? - Stay close, Pookie!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.32,1:02:44.46,en,,0,0,0,,He says, "There is ze human."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.46,1:02:45.86,en,,0,0,0,,He has a French accent.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.57,1:02:54.30,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny's not a human. He's my right arm's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.30,1:02:56.70,en,,0,0,0,,- He's lying. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.71,1:02:57.64,en,,0,0,0,,And why is he picking his nose?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.54,1:03:02.11,en,,0,0,0,,He says, "It's a long story."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.11,1:03:04.18,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, no! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.62,1:03:10.32,en,,0,0,0,,He says, "Behold ze human."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.72,1:03:14.05,en,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.83,1:03:23.66,en,,0,0,0,,Is it true? Are you a human?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.37,1:03:26.80,en,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:29.17,en,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.47,1:03:33.97,en,,0,0,0,,I don't care. I still want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.12,1:03:48.52,en,,0,0,0,,Well, tough. 'Cause I don't want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.52,1:03:51.76,en,,0,0,0,,Because you're a monster. And I hate monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.59,1:03:55.26,en,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:58.27,en,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.90,1:04:03.94,en,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.24,1:04:09.14,en,,0,0,0,,- We're getting out of here. - I'm never coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.14,1:04:10.71,en,,0,0,0,,I thought I smelt a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.71,1:04:12.41,en,,0,0,0,,"Human-free"? What a rip.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.93,1:04:27.63,en,,0,0,0,,Oh. Here he comes. Count Crock-ula.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.63,1:04:29.73,en,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad my eyes are stitched shut,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.73,1:04:31.30,en,,0,0,0,,'cause I don't even want to...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.94,1:04:36.47,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis, honey, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.74,1:04:41.31,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis? Mavis?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.44,1:04:45.48,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.48,1:04:47.25,en,,0,0,0,,Mavis?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.00,1:05:10.27,en,,0,0,0,,Dad, can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.27,1:05:13.67,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, of course, darling. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.68,1:05:15.21,en,,0,0,0,,Will you erase my mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.98,1:05:21.15,en,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no. No, I won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.15,1:05:24.12,en,,0,0,0,,There's too much I want you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.12,1:05:28.12,en,,0,0,0,,You were right, Dad. The humans hate us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.12,1:05:31.66,en,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, there are so many eligible monsters out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.66,1:05:32.89,en,,0,0,0,,You're so young to...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.33,1:05:36.36,en,,0,0,0,,What is it? What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.24,1:05:46.21,en,,0,0,0,,"Two lonely bats crashed in the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.41,1:05:53.38,en,,0,0,0,,"They felt a Zing. Love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.38,1:05:56.88,en,,0,0,0,,"They knew right then they would be husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.95,1:06:02.09,en,,0,0,0,,"For a Zing only happens once in your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.82,1:06:04.93,en,,0,0,0,,"Your Zing will come, my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.93,1:06:06.53,en,,0,0,0,,"Cherish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.53,1:06:08.86,en,,0,0,0,,"Love, Mommy."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.70,1:06:14.92,en,,0,0,0,,I thought we Zinged, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.92,1:06:16.70,en,,0,0,0,,You and Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.71,1:06:19.67,en,,0,0,0,,I guess it was only me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.68,1:06:21.88,en,,0,0,0,,But you should be happy, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.88,1:06:23.91,en,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for me to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.91,1:06:27.98,en,,0,0,0,,I have no more dreams. I'm just like you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.48,1:06:57.34,en,,0,0,0,,Martha, what have I done?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.25,1:07:05.05,en,,0,0,0,,Where is my bill?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.05,1:07:06.15,en,,0,0,0,,- Over here. - I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.15,1:07:08.56,en,,0,0,0,,- I'm checking out. - Take my key! Take my key!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.16,1:07:11.52,en,,0,0,0,,What is this minibar charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.53,1:07:13.56,en,,0,0,0,,Honey, the kids threw the minibar out the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.56,1:07:15.96,en,,0,0,0,,- And that's our fault? - Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.96,1:07:18.60,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Pardon, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.60,1:07:21.53,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I got a couple of people to express mail.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.27,1:07:25.11,en,,0,0,0,,Friends, please, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.11,1:07:27.44,en,,0,0,0,,It's too late, rat-bat!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.44,1:07:28.98,en,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.98,1:07:31.91,en,,0,0,0,,I need you to help me find Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.91,1:07:33.85,en,,0,0,0,,The human? He could've killed us!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.85,1:07:35.98,en,,0,0,0,,He touched my guitar!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.98,1:07:39.99,en,,0,0,0,,He put his hand in my mouth to see if it would disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.99,1:07:43.69,en,,0,0,0,,He let me eat his scooter!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.79,1:07:47.16,en,,0,0,0,,I know I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.16,1:07:49.03,en,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.03,1:07:50.93,en,,0,0,0,,But you have to believe this:
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.93,1:07:54.43,en,,0,0,0,,Johnny wasn't a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.90,1:07:56.64,en,,0,0,0,,The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.64,1:07:59.64,en,,0,0,0,,I don't even know if humans are bad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.94,1:08:06.41,en,,0,0,0,,Frank, come on, buddy. You understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.42,1:08:08.32,en,,0,0,0,,He's not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.32,1:08:10.72,en,,0,0,0,,First you tell us humans are bad, now they're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.72,1:08:11.91,en,,0,0,0,,What else? Up is down,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.91,1:08:13.45,en,,0,0,0,,cold is hot, gremlins don't smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.09,1:08:19.83,en,,0,0,0,,I really liked Johnny, cousin or no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.83,1:08:21.19,en,,0,0,0,,He told fun stories.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.20,1:08:23.20,en,,0,0,0,,I think they Zinged.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.20,1:08:24.76,en,,0,0,0,,They Zinged?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.77,1:08:27.70,en,,0,0,0,,But I got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.70,1:08:30.27,en,,0,0,0,,You only Zing once in your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.51,1:08:34.67,en,,0,0,0,,- Oy, now you're short-circuiting. - I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.68,1:08:37.34,en,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we doing? Let's get Johnny. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.35,1:08:39.35,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.50,1:09:02.17,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.17,1:09:05.01,en,,0,0,0,,The human world, before Johnny's gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.01,1:09:06.94,en,,0,0,0,,But what about the sun?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.94,1:09:10.31,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I'll just have to roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.31,1:09:12.08,en,,0,0,0,,He just rolls. Rollability.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.25,1:09:14.81,en,,0,0,0,,So we follow his boot-prints.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.82,1:09:16.98,en,,0,0,0,,When they run out, that's where you come in, Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.99,1:09:18.15,en,,0,0,0,,- Me? - There!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.16,1:09:24.22,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew something would fall out of that backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.69,1:09:27.99,en,,0,0,0,,Yowch! That stinks!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.00,1:09:29.43,en,,0,0,0,,Work your magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.43,1:09:31.87,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, you want me to track the smell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.87,1:09:34.30,en,,0,0,0,,No. My sniffing tracking days are way behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.30,1:09:36.24,en,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many diapers I've changed?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.24,1:09:38.54,en,,0,0,0,,How many number twos have destroyed this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.54,1:09:40.11,en,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.59,1:09:55.59,en,,0,0,0,,Hey! Take it easy! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.72,1:09:58.22,en,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.13,1:10:01.33,en,,0,0,0,,Smell. I said smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.13,1:10:06.63,en,,0,0,0,,Not me, the shirt! The shirt!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.64,1:10:09.54,en,,0,0,0,,Do any of your kids still respect you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.54,1:10:12.24,en,,0,0,0,,Mm, give me a second. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.24,1:10:15.24,en,,0,0,0,,Winnie! Front and center!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.59,1:10:28.05,en,,0,0,0,,He got into a car. A '86 Fiat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.06,1:10:30.13,en,,0,0,0,,It needs a little transmission work,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.13,1:10:32.76,en,,0,0,0,,but otherwise okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.76,1:10:37.40,en,,0,0,0,,It drove through town to the airport. Flight 497.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.40,1:10:38.97,en,,0,0,0,,8:00 a.m. departure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.97,1:10:40.83,en,,0,0,0,,That's in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.84,1:10:43.37,en,,0,0,0,,Seat 23A.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.37,1:10:44.90,en,,0,0,0,,He ordered the vegetarian meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.91,1:10:47.51,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.51,1:10:49.28,en,,0,0,0,,Now, all of you, go back to your mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.75,1:10:58.75,en,,0,0,0,,Sheep!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.73,1:11:11.36,en,,0,0,0,,High five! Don't leave me hanging.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.67,1:11:14.87,en,,0,0,0,,- Lots of sheep! - I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.08,1:11:24.98,en,,0,0,0,,What? Now there's no sheep in the road. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.98,1:11:26.85,en,,0,0,0,,That was pretty sick, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.85,1:11:29.32,en,,0,0,0,,You eat lamb chops, it's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.32,1:11:30.72,en,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this. Come on, let's move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.16,1:11:36.89,en,,0,0,0,,Look, a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.03,1:11:43.43,en,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Transylvania!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.07,1:11:48.97,en,,0,0,0,,That was trippy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.97,1:11:50.27,en,,0,0,0,,Monster Festival?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.14,1:11:52.24,en,,0,0,0,,What's a Monster Festival?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.21,1:12:01.18,en,,0,0,0,,Did they know we were coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.14,1:12:25.91,en,,0,0,0,,They like us?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.91,1:12:27.31,en,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.04,1:12:31.95,en,,0,0,0,,Excuse me? Do you know the best way to the airport?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.95,1:12:33.40,en,,0,0,0,,Yes, fellow Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.40,1:12:36.15,en,,0,0,0,,There's only one way. Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.15,1:12:39.35,en,,0,0,0,,But it's all blocked. We'll never make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.35,1:12:41.99,en,,0,0,0,,You should have left an hour earlier. Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.99,1:12:45.43,en,,0,0,0,,I do not say "Bleh, bleh-bleh."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.43,1:12:47.79,en,,0,0,0,,All right, let's just run through it on foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.00,1:12:56.27,en,,0,0,0,,Drac, this'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.27,1:12:57.90,en,,0,0,0,,Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.91,1:12:59.07,en,,0,0,0,,Imagine if that guy knew
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.07,1:13:00.47,en,,0,0,0,,he was talking to the real Drac.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.48,1:13:02.38,en,,0,0,0,,He'd run for the hills!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.38,1:13:04.54,en,,0,0,0,,Hold it, now. Hold it, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.55,1:13:06.55,en,,0,0,0,,That sounds spot on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.55,1:13:07.88,en,,0,0,0,,But the only way they'd
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.89,1:13:10.38,en,,0,0,0,,know the real us is if we show the real us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.39,1:13:12.15,en,,0,0,0,,This could work.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:13.22,en,,0,0,0,,You mean, like, scare them?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.22,1:13:14.72,en,,0,0,0,,We haven't scared people in centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.72,1:13:16.89,en,,0,0,0,,I don't even think I have it in me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.06,1:13:21.59,en,,0,0,0,,I got nothing. I really got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.60,1:13:23.00,en,,0,0,0,,Let's just move this along.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.50,1:13:32.87,en,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.87,1:13:34.01,en,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.66,1:13:50.52,en,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to scare you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.53,1:13:52.43,en,,0,0,0,,The real Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.43,1:13:54.43,en,,0,0,0,,We know! We love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.43,1:13:55.76,en,,0,0,0,,Can you sign my torch?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.90,1:13:59.96,en,,0,0,0,,Listen, before anything else,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.96,1:14:03.47,en,,0,0,0,,down there's the real Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.47,1:14:04.90,en,,0,0,0,,Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.21,1:14:07.91,en,,0,0,0,,All right. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.91,1:14:11.61,en,,0,0,0,,Drac's daughter's in love, and he's got to get to the airport!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.61,1:14:14.01,en,,0,0,0,,And he can't get through this crowd!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.02,1:14:15.07,en,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.07,1:14:17.58,en,,0,0,0,,The sun, you idiot. He's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.59,1:14:20.49,en,,0,0,0,,That's right. Thank you, Monster Nerd.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.49,1:14:23.58,en,,0,0,0,,So, people, if you really are our friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.58,1:14:25.43,en,,0,0,0,,clear a path for the man!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.43,1:14:28.55,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. All Draculas, line up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.55,1:14:28.93,en,,0,0,0,,Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.20,1:14:34.94,en,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, lift the capes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.94,1:14:37.04,en,,0,0,0,,Protect our friend. Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.38,1:14:46.95,en,,0,0,0,,It's all for you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.35,1:14:50.28,en,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.29,1:14:51.38,en,,0,0,0,,Good luck! Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.39,1:14:52.69,en,,0,0,0,,Go, Drac, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.69,1:14:54.39,en,,0,0,0,,Go, Drac! Go, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.39,1:14:55.92,en,,0,0,0,,Go, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.06,1:14:59.79,en,,0,0,0,,Go, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.36,1:15:04.23,en,,0,0,0,,Go, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.23,1:15:05.87,en,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.43,1:15:09.34,en,,0,0,0,,Go, Drac, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.34,1:15:12.61,en,,0,0,0,,We love you, Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.45,1:15:28.62,en,,0,0,0,,There's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.66,1:16:10.63,en,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay, I must do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.25,1:16:32.92,en,,0,0,0,,Jonathan. Jonathan, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.92,1:16:36.16,en,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you drm of being a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.16,1:16:38.89,en,,0,0,0,,This is how we're represented. Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.89,1:16:40.86,en,,0,0,0,,Jonathan. Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.70,1:16:43.13,en,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.13,1:16:44.86,en,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Bat!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.87,1:16:47.47,en,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's talking. Dracula? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.10,1:16:50.44,en,,0,0,0,,Huh? Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.44,1:16:53.17,en,,0,0,0,,I can't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.17,1:16:56.34,en,,0,0,0,,What? My hand's in a tan shoe?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.34,1:17:00.48,en,,0,0,0,,What? Japan's eating lamb stew?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.48,1:17:02.08,en,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know you're smoking?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.42,1:17:10.59,en,,0,0,0,,Pardon me. Sorry, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.59,1:17:12.09,en,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.97,1:17:30.41,en,,0,0,0,,What the heck? How'd a bat get up this high?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.41,1:17:32.54,en,,0,0,0,,Folks, I'm gonna turn on the seat belt sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.54,1:17:33.95,en,,0,0,0,,Just a precaution while we...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.92,1:17:38.86,en,,0,0,0,,While we hear a special announcement
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.86,1:17:41.52,en,,0,0,0,,for my dear friend Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.52,1:17:42.99,en,,0,0,0,,Dracula?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.99,1:17:47.49,en,,0,0,0,,My dear boy, I have made a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.50,1:17:51.16,en,,0,0,0,,I was trying to keep my baby to myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.17,1:17:54.30,en,,0,0,0,,because I knew I would always protect her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.30,1:17:55.78,en,,0,0,0,,But I realize now,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.78,1:17:59.71,en,,0,0,0,,children need to discover things for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.71,1:18:03.44,en,,0,0,0,,They'll stumble and fall, laugh and cry,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.44,1:18:05.58,en,,0,0,0,,but such is life.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.58,1:18:08.75,en,,0,0,0,,The truth is, you and Mavis are meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.75,1:18:10.62,en,,0,0,0,,You Zinged.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.62,1:18:13.59,en,,0,0,0,,If she must give her trust to someone else,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.59,1:18:16.86,en,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful that it is you, Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.86,1:18:21.09,en,,0,0,0,,I hope you can hear me and forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.21,1:18:39.68,en,,0,0,0,,Okay, folks, we're going to make a quick turnaround to refuel,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.68,1:18:41.58,en,,0,0,0,,and then we'lle back on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.08,1:18:45.35,en,,0,0,0,,Quit your whining! I'm burning up out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:18:59.93,en,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.97,1:19:06.17,en,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm just a little sunburnt.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.64,1:19:09.88,en,,0,0,0,,Honey,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.85,1:19:15.92,en,,0,0,0,,I always thought the worst thing ever would be seeing you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.92,1:19:19.59,en,,0,0,0,,But the worst is seeing you unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.59,1:19:22.19,en,,0,0,0,,Mavey, I want you to live your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.96,1:19:26.63,en,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I'm supposed to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.53,1:19:31.73,en,,0,0,0,,You know, Mommy already gave you her birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.73,1:19:33.67,en,,0,0,0,,Can I now give you mine?
