Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.81,1:19:40.01,en,,0,0,0,,Oh, it comes with an accessory.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.18,1:19:44.34,en,,0,0,0,,- You? - You.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.41,1:19:46.68,en,,0,0,0,,Why are you back?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.72,1:19:52.62,en,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're my Zing, Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.62,1:19:54.82,en,,0,0,0,,I'm your Zing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.82,1:19:57.89,en,,0,0,0,,But you told me you hate monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.89,1:20:00.96,en,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I was afraid your dad was gonna
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.96,1:20:02.93,en,,0,0,0,,suck all the blood out of my body if I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.93,1:20:05.03,en,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.03,1:20:06.87,en,,0,0,0,,No, he's right, I would have done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.87,1:20:09.77,en,,0,0,0,,- Dad. - I was wrong, Devil-chops.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.54,1:20:15.34,en,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean it, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.98,1:20:19.11,en,,0,0,0,,Go make your own paradise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.15,1:20:25.62,en,,0,0,0,,Can we try that kiss over again?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.62,1:20:28.32,en,,0,0,0,,I think we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.23,1:20:35.80,en,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I just... I got to get used to that.
